    "notes": "A Lethal Lottery random-draw tag-team tournament card, opened on an \"Insane Asylum\" cold-open cage set. Also crowns a new Hardcore Champion (Blackheart Paul Vega) and a new Television Champion (KC \"Loose\" Cannon). Closes on an Iron Man Match for the NEWF World Title: Alex Star, defending against a late-announced opponent after the originally-planned challenger (Speed Racer) became ineligible as the reigning US Champion, loses the title to Most Holy — the fed's own last recorded champion in the held record. Structured to full match/appearance detail; managers and valets named only in ring introductions (e.g. Kellie, Ahmed, Zoe, Master P, Shirley Manson, Sonia Sterling, Chastity, Calypso, Ken Ray, Overkill, Miss Jacqueline) were not minted as separate entities — a bounded, curatorial choice given their zero further content, not a corpus gap.",
